<speak>That would be helpful. I tend to go quiet when I am reading, and people sometimes assume the line has dropped. If that happens, I am probably looking for a heading rather than waiting for you to repeat yourself. I have also brought a notebook I use for personal administration. It is not especially sophisticated, but it stops private matters becoming mixed up with the business action list. My assistant can see the latter, whereas this notebook stays with me. I am becoming more deliberate about keeping those areas separate.</speak>